        <div class="why-choose-spc" style="background:url('/Images/home/SPC-Spring-2024-Graduation-Ceremony.jpg') no-repeat 0px 0px/cover;">
            <div class="why-choose-spc-container">
                <h2>Why Choose SPC</h2>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="small-12 large-4 columns">
                        <div class="why-choose-num">
                            300+
                        </div>
                        <p>Associate degree, 
certificate and transfer 
programs, including 
22 bachelor&#39;s degrees and many workforce certifications and short-term training opportunities</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="small-12 large-4 columns">
                        <div class="why-choose-num">
                            92%
                        </div>
                        <p>Of our Associate in Science graduates find jobs in their fields or are continuing their education after graduation.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="small-12 large-4 columns">
                        <div class="why-choose-num">
                            50%
                        </div>
                        <p>Less per credit hour than state universities, so you spend less for a high-quality, fully accredited education.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="testimonials-container">

                        <div class="testimonial-block">
                            <h2>Others Like You</h2>
                            <div class="owl-carousel owl-theme">

                                        <div class="testimonial-item">
                                            <div class="testimonial-image">
                                                <a href="spc-newsroom/luisa-shamas" title="View Luisa's Story" target="_self">
                                                    <img src="/Images/people/Luisa-Shamas.jpg" alt="Luisa Shamas" />
                                                </a>

                                            </div>

                                            <div class="testimonial-text">
                                                <blockquote>
                                                    <p class="quote">Even if you’re older, or you have to restart your life, you are going to be able to do it because you have SPC.</p>
                                                </blockquote>
                                                <p class="cite">&ndash;&nbsp;Luisa&nbsp;Shamas</p>
                                                <a href="spc-newsroom/luisa-shamas" title="View Luisa's Story" target="_self">View Luisa's Story</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="testimonial-item">
                                            <div class="testimonial-image">
                                                <a href="edith-palma-hernandez" title="View Edith's Story" target="_self">
                                                    <img src="/Images/people/Edith-Palma-Hernandez.jpg" alt="Edith Palma-Hernandez" />
                                                </a>

                                            </div>

                                            <div class="testimonial-text">
                                                <blockquote>
                                                    <p class="quote">The Promise Scholarship is a big thing for me and my family.</p>
                                                </blockquote>
                                                <p class="cite">&ndash;&nbsp;Edith&nbsp;Palma-Hernandez</p>
                                                <a href="edith-palma-hernandez" title="View Edith's Story" target="_self">View Edith's Story</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="testimonial-item">
                                            <div class="testimonial-image">
                                                <a href="spc-newsroom/terry-ellison" title="View Terry's Story" target="_self">
                                                    <img src="/Images/people/Terry-Ellison.jpg" alt="Terry Ellison" />
                                                </a>

                                            </div>

                                            <div class="testimonial-text">
                                                <blockquote>
                                                    <p class="quote">The faculty felt like family to me, and they really encouraged their students to work together and network.</p>
                                                </blockquote>
                                                <p class="cite">&ndash;&nbsp;Terry&nbsp;Ellison</p>
                                                <a href="spc-newsroom/terry-ellison" title="View Terry's Story" target="_self">View Terry's Story</a>
